  triage:title "AM1-RM-001's deletion-order prose omits two of its own listed callers (minor, not a live contradiction)" ;
  triage:description "AM1-RM-001's 'Remaining live callers' column names local_tcp_transport (AM1-RM-004) and local_ipc_transport::{request_worker,shutdown} (AM1-RM-013) as callers of its symbols, but its 'Deletion order' cell only says it 'follows AM1-RM-002/003/005's raw-frame edges', omitting AM1-RM-004 and AM1-RM-013 from that explicit predecessor list. The top-level 'Frozen order' section resolves this correctly by grouping all AM.3-owned rows before AM.2, so there is no live ordering contradiction -- this is an incomplete cross-reference in the row-level prose relative to its own caller column, not a functional defect." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-am" ;
